{"text": "竞争力的薪资福利", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_990f0b7dfbdf2fbca9d84bcd", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 20, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n竞争力的薪资福利", "prev_chunk_id": "H_020375693dcdf96c131a6def", "next_chunk_id": "H_ef9dffd777cc0ca570b1b3ba"}
{"text": "中国生物制药制定实施适用集团及成员企业的《薪酬管理制度》，以保证工资的正确认定和发放，确保公司和员工利益。同时，公司积极参与行业知名调研公司的薪酬调研，获取最准确的市场数据。持续关注全球薪酬的动态、关注国内行业经济形势、关注跨区域的市场薪酬水平，为员工提供具有竞争力的薪酬体系。后续还会针对关键人才，提供有效的长期激励措施，以减少高绩效高潜能人才的流失。同时，时刻保持对薪资市场的敏感度，定期对员工整体薪酬制定合理调薪计划，对在海外工作的员工，集团还提供了企业年金保障。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_ef9dffd777cc0ca570b1b3ba", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 21, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n中国生物制药制定实施适用集团及成员企业的《薪酬管理制度》，以保证工资的正确认定和发放，确保公司和员工利益。同时，公司积极参与行业知名调研公司的薪酬调研，获取最准确的市场数据。持续关注全球薪酬的动态、关注国内行业经济形势、关注跨区域的市场薪酬水平，为员工提供具有竞争力的薪酬体系。后续还会针对关键人才，提供有效的长期激励措施，以减少高绩效高潜能人才的流失。同时，时刻保持对薪资市场的敏感度，定期对员工整体薪酬制定合理调薪计划，对在海外工作的员工，集团还提供了企业年金保障。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_990f0b7dfbdf2fbca9d84bcd", "next_chunk_id": "H_3a982ae7e01c7ecc0ca4ffd1"}
{"text": "1.制定原则。公平、竞争、激励、合法合规。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_3a982ae7e01c7ecc0ca4ffd1", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 22, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n1.制定原则。公平、竞争、激励、合法合规。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_ef9dffd777cc0ca570b1b3ba", "next_chunk_id": "H_032be41b749cb850127fffd8"}
{"text": "2.管理机构。薪酬与考核委员会为管理机构，人力资源部承办具体事宜。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_032be41b749cb850127fffd8", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 23, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n2.管理机构。薪酬与考核委员会为管理机构，人力资源部承办具体事宜。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_3a982ae7e01c7ecc0ca4ffd1", "next_chunk_id": "H_1b23dba59d5f63c23aa17ca0"}
{"text": "3.薪酬组成。员工薪酬由基本工资+加班费+浮动奖金+各类补贴+各类津贴组成。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_1b23dba59d5f63c23aa17ca0", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 24, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n3.薪酬组成。员工薪酬由基本工资+加班费+浮动奖金+各类补贴+各类津贴组成。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_032be41b749cb850127fffd8", "next_chunk_id": "H_3b4e3df6c5e065b5dac61d1e"}
{"text": "4.薪酬调整。分为整体调整和个别调整。整体调整根据公司整体业绩，原则上每年调整一次基本工资。个别调整指因员工职务变动等原因，公司对员工的薪酬进行的个别调整。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_3b4e3df6c5e065b5dac61d1e", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 25, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n4.薪酬调整。分为整体调整和个别调整。整体调整根据公司整体业绩，原则上每年调整一次基本工资。个别调整指因员工职务变动等原因，公司对员工的薪酬进行的个别调整。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_1b23dba59d5f63c23aa17ca0", "next_chunk_id": "H_a9fba0295d96117d05f9e7b9"}
{"text": "5.特殊情况下的工资计算。包括病假、事假、迟到、早退、旷工等期间的工资计算。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_a9fba0295d96117d05f9e7b9", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 26, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n5.特殊情况下的工资计算。包括病假、事假、迟到、早退、旷工等期间的工资计算。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_3b4e3df6c5e065b5dac61d1e", "next_chunk_id": "H_a09ebc6b0a09bd0361480251"}
{"text": "6.薪酬的计算与支付。包括薪酬发放时间计算、从薪酬中必须扣除款项、中途聘用或离职人员工资计算等。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_a09ebc6b0a09bd0361480251", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 27, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n6.薪酬的计算与支付。包括薪酬发放时间计算、从薪酬中必须扣除款项、中途聘用或离职人员工资计算等。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_a9fba0295d96117d05f9e7b9", "next_chunk_id": "H_892b1d8512f33b47b9d1920a"}
{"text": "7.监督制度。薪酬由人力资源部门计算制单、集团财务部审核发放，应符合公司相关制度和规范并接受审计的监督。公司推荐并在控股、参股企业担任董、监事、顾问的收入，应定期向薪酬委员会报告。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "Sustainable Development", "chunk_id": "H_892b1d8512f33b47b9d1920a", "source_id": "01177_82eda4675c36bb553d8b91359ee9c06d7328cb2ad250911955b903e533d82cd8", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 28, "section": "Sustainable Development"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\nSustainable Development\n[Content]\n7.监督制度。薪酬由人力资源部门计算制单、集团财务部审核发放，应符合公司相关制度和规范并接受审计的监督。公司推荐并在控股、参股企业担任董、监事、顾问的收入，应定期向薪酬委员会报告。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_a09ebc6b0a09bd0361480251", "next_chunk_id": "H_e05515aea1d513992a58b60a"}
